sequenceDiagram
    participant W as Worker
    participant F as FinSight API
    participant CB as Circuit Breaker
    participant DLQ as Dead Letter Queue
    W->>CB: Request permission
    CB-->>W: Closed / allow
    W->>F: Upsert with idempotency key
    F-->>W: 429 or 5xx
    W->>W: Honour Retry-After / backoff with jitter
    W->>CB: Record failure
    alt retries exhausted or permanent error
        W->>DLQ: Store sanitized failure metadata
    else service recovers
        W->>F: Retry safely
        F-->>W: Accepted
    end
